	"system": {
		"description": "<p>A job no one wishes to do, and few are willing to do: you've long become skilled at digging perfectly useable holes in the ground. With 3 hours of labor you can dig a grave instead of the usual 8. In communities with a cemetary, this affords you a moderate lifestyle for a day's work, or a poor one in communities without as you are relegated to manual labor. In communities with necromancers or scientists looking for fresh cadavers, however, 3 hours of work secures a moderate lifestyle for a week. In addition, you can clear rubble in half the normal time.</p>",
